WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.000 --> 01:55.720
=Episode 13=

22
01:58.276 --> 01:58.717
Mom,

23
01:58.996 --> 02:00.356
why did you take my bag?

24
02:05.597 --> 02:06.196
Mom,

25
02:06.877 --> 02:08.277
have you really lost your mind?

26
02:09.796 --> 02:10.157
Fine.

27
02:10.837 --> 02:11.277
I'll tell you

28
02:11.277 --> 02:12.317
everything today.

29
02:12.837 --> 02:13.916
Do you know why that scammer

30
02:14.117 --> 02:14.756
knew so much

31
02:14.796 --> 02:15.756
about our family?

32
02:16.397 --> 02:16.997
Because that scammer

33
02:17.076 --> 02:18.076
is part of our family!

34
02:20.117 --> 02:21.157
Di Liren wasn't just

35
02:21.236 --> 02:22.277
simply flirting

36
02:22.317 --> 02:23.236
or slacking off.

37
02:23.476 --> 02:24.356
He's having an affair.

38
02:25.037 --> 02:26.277
He's trying to scam our family

39
02:26.356 --> 02:27.476
and siphon off our assets.

40
02:28.076 --> 02:29.476
And that's not even the worst part.

41
02:29.756 --> 02:30.837
The worst part is

42
02:30.997 --> 02:32.076
he was married before,

43
02:32.196 --> 02:33.317
and his ex-wife is none other

44
02:33.437 --> 02:34.397
than our housekeeper,

45
02:34.476 --> 02:34.916
Lu Hui!

46
02:35.037 --> 02:35.916
That's impossible.

47
02:36.317 --> 02:37.236
Are you sure about this?

48
02:37.717 --> 02:38.317
Lu Hui?

49
02:38.756 --> 02:39.597
There's no way.

50
02:39.837 --> 02:40.676
You don't believe me?

51
02:41.196 --> 02:42.476
Fine, I'll show you the photos.

52
02:42.956 --> 02:44.037
I don't want to see them.

53
02:44.356 --> 02:45.997
Everything online is fake.

54
02:46.317 --> 02:47.037
I won't listen.

55
02:47.476 --> 02:48.437
I must stay grounded.

56
02:51.476 --> 02:52.076
Mom,

57
02:52.756 --> 02:54.117
you're really driving me crazy!

58
02:55.196 --> 02:55.636
I found it.

59
02:56.037 --> 02:56.756
Xiuyuan's account

60
02:56.756 --> 02:57.476
was sold not long ago,

61
02:57.597 --> 02:58.837
around Mr. Yu's hospitalization.

62
02:59.236 --> 03:00.236
Di Liren probably started

63
03:00.236 --> 03:00.997
setting up then.

64
03:01.796 --> 03:02.837
I'm on my way to you.

65
03:03.196 --> 03:03.956
Stay calm.

66
03:13.956 --> 03:15.676
Mr. Di, what a coincidence.

67
03:15.916 --> 03:17.117
I'm picking up Yu Meng too.

68
03:19.356 --> 03:20.676
Liu Zi asked me

69
03:21.196 --> 03:22.676
to make sure she gets

70
03:23.076 --> 03:24.236
home safely.

71
03:29.597 --> 03:30.756
That scoundrel Di Liren.

72
03:31.037 --> 03:31.557
He and Lu Hui

73
03:31.557 --> 03:32.476
have no bottom line.

74
03:32.877 --> 03:33.796
They found a fake mystic

75
03:33.837 --> 03:34.516
to brainwash my mom

76
03:34.636 --> 03:35.317
and set her up.

77
03:36.117 --> 03:38.236
Those two are completely unscrupulous.

78
03:38.437 --> 03:39.997
Who could've seen this coming?

79
03:40.117 --> 03:41.756
Now the shareholder meeting

80
03:42.196 --> 03:43.397
is a total bust.

81
03:43.796 --> 03:45.037
Before my mom went up the mountain,

82
03:45.157 --> 03:46.196
she texted Mr. Tian

83
03:46.317 --> 03:47.236
and made herself clear.

84
03:47.636 --> 03:48.277
She said

85
03:48.397 --> 03:49.837
she'll stay away from power struggles

86
03:49.916 --> 03:50.837
and worldly affairs,

87
03:51.157 --> 03:52.916
devoting herself to praying for my dad.

88
03:53.196 --> 03:54.476
And as for the vote,

89
03:54.796 --> 03:55.916
she gave Mr. Tian

90
03:55.916 --> 03:56.597
full authority.

91
03:57.196 --> 03:58.397
How can your mom

92
03:58.476 --> 03:59.437
not tell a friend from foe

93
03:59.516 --> 04:00.956
or what really matters?

94
04:02.196 --> 04:03.796
Should I go talk to her?

95
04:05.117 --> 04:05.997
Don't bother.

96
04:06.597 --> 04:07.877
Mr. Tian is already acting.

97
04:08.476 --> 04:09.277
Besides,

98
04:10.277 --> 04:11.516
let my mom have some peace.

99
04:12.117 --> 04:13.196
Without my dad,

100
04:13.796 --> 04:14.837
she feels completely lost.

101
04:15.196 --> 04:16.077
Is she safe alone?

102
04:16.476 --> 04:17.197
I checked.

103
04:17.397 --> 04:18.517
It's just an ordinary inn,

104
04:18.757 --> 04:20.116
and I paid the owner extra

105
04:20.277 --> 04:21.436
to look after her safety.

106
04:24.996 --> 04:26.597
Did Liu Bai forget his key?

107
04:30.717 --> 04:31.157
Good evening.

108
04:31.916 --> 04:32.397
Harry?

109
04:33.197 --> 04:33.796
Why are you here?

110
04:34.796 --> 04:36.597
I came to deliver the final cut for review.

111
04:36.916 --> 04:37.757
I asked Liu Bai,

112
04:37.757 --> 04:38.676
and he said

113
04:38.957 --> 04:39.476
you're all here.

114
04:40.556 --> 04:40.996
Here.

115
04:47.556 --> 04:47.957
Meng,

116
04:49.037 --> 04:49.637
what's wrong?

117
04:50.996 --> 04:51.676
I'm fine.

118
04:52.757 --> 04:54.197
You're really dedicated,

119
04:54.356 --> 04:55.876
delivering work material so late.

120
04:56.116 --> 04:56.676
All done?

121
04:56.957 --> 04:57.957
I'll drive you home.

122
05:01.517 --> 05:02.037
Take care.

123
05:02.316 --> 05:03.077
Bye, then.

124
05:03.316 --> 05:03.837
Bye.

125
05:15.876 --> 05:16.397
Xu,

126
05:17.476 --> 05:18.517
I've been wondering,

127
05:19.157 --> 05:20.316
how did you

128
05:20.597 --> 05:21.436
and Meng meet?

129
05:22.037 --> 05:22.757
What do you think?

130
05:23.637 --> 05:24.916
Well,

131
05:26.236 --> 05:26.957
whenever Meng talks

132
05:26.957 --> 05:27.916
about her husband,

133
05:28.556 --> 05:29.397
she looks so happy.

134
05:29.837 --> 05:30.316
So

135
05:31.077 --> 05:31.637
she probably

136
05:31.717 --> 05:32.517
isn't your client.

137
05:33.476 --> 05:34.837
Haven't you met her husband?

138
05:35.236 --> 05:35.796
No.

139
05:41.445 --> 05:45.058
(Take pills)

140
05:52.197 --> 05:53.077
That's a lot of pills.

141
05:53.676 --> 05:54.637
Are you feeling sick?

142
05:57.116 --> 05:57.957
Just vitamins,

143
05:58.316 --> 05:59.517
lutein, fish oil, and stuff.

144
05:59.717 --> 06:00.356
In that case,

145
06:00.717 --> 06:01.676
give me a lutein pill

146
06:01.717 --> 06:02.277
for my eyes.

147
06:02.556 --> 06:03.197
Sorry,

148
06:03.356 --> 06:04.277
I'm out of lutein.

149
06:10.996 --> 06:11.556
Sorry.

150
06:11.876 --> 06:12.916
The light just turned red.

151
06:13.676 --> 06:14.236
No problem.

152
06:23.876 --> 06:24.356
Xu,

153
06:24.597 --> 06:25.356
just drop me off

154
06:25.356 --> 06:26.116
at the next corner.

155
06:26.277 --> 06:27.116
I live nearby.

156
06:28.837 --> 06:29.236
Sure.

157
06:37.356 --> 06:37.837
Bye, Xu.

158
07:02.157 --> 07:02.717
Hey, buddy,

159
07:03.316 --> 07:04.796
use your medical expertise

160
07:04.916 --> 07:05.996
and see what pills they are.

161
07:06.356 --> 07:07.236
I need it for a case.

162
07:07.476 --> 07:07.876
Thanks.

163
07:24.957 --> 07:26.517
Mr. Tian, can we have a word?

164
07:26.757 --> 07:27.277
Go on in.

165
07:27.916 --> 07:28.757
Of course, Mr. Di.

166
07:28.757 --> 07:29.197
What's wrong?

167
07:29.316 --> 07:29.837
Mr. Tian,

168
07:30.236 --> 07:31.556
why did you abstain?

169
07:31.957 --> 07:32.397
Hello.

170
07:33.197 --> 07:33.676
Meng,

171
07:34.397 --> 07:35.037
well,

172
07:35.517 --> 07:36.556
I thought about it

173
07:36.996 --> 07:37.957
and felt it was wrong.

174
07:38.356 --> 07:39.556
These are critical times.

175
07:39.996 --> 07:41.597
Your mom couldn't take the shock

176
07:41.597 --> 07:43.112
and went up the mountain to meditate.

177
07:43.837 --> 07:45.397
I don't want her to think

178
07:45.796 --> 07:46.397
I'm trying

179
07:46.556 --> 07:48.116
to make a move on Jiali

180
07:48.916 --> 07:50.077
while your father is sick.

181
07:50.397 --> 07:51.077
Excuse me.

182
07:52.316 --> 07:53.397
Liren can handle it.

183
07:53.676 --> 07:54.436
He's capable.

184
07:54.916 --> 07:55.277
Mr. Tian,

185
07:55.556 --> 07:56.077
shall we go in?

186
07:56.277 --> 07:56.637
Okay.

187
07:57.197 --> 07:57.517
Let's go.

188
07:58.037 --> 07:58.397
After you.

189
07:58.796 --> 08:00.277
Thank you all for coming.

190
08:01.556 --> 08:02.757
Today is this year's second

191
08:02.757 --> 08:03.436
shareholder meeting

192
08:03.517 --> 08:04.397
of Jiali Cosmetics.

193
08:05.277 --> 08:06.837
I'll first read the agenda.

194
08:07.236 --> 08:07.916
Item one,

195
08:08.717 --> 08:09.397
the shareholder vote.

196
08:09.796 --> 08:11.116
Based on the vote,

197
08:11.757 --> 08:12.597
we'll decide on the spot

198
08:12.996 --> 08:14.637
who receives interim signing authority

199
08:14.996 --> 08:15.837
for Jiali Cosmetics

200
08:16.236 --> 08:17.436
while Mr. Yu Jianguo recovers.

201
08:21.277 --> 08:21.717
(Agenda Item One)

202
08:21.717 --> 08:22.397
One vote for Lin Yue.

203
08:23.316 --> 08:24.157
One vote for Zheng Mengqi.

204
08:25.397 --> 08:26.197
One vote for Lin Zhihua.

205
08:27.717 --> 08:28.597
One vote for Di Liren.

206
08:29.556 --> 08:30.397
One vote for Lin Zhihua.

207
08:31.916 --> 08:32.676
One vote for Di Liren.

208
08:33.997 --> 08:34.716
One vote for Di Liren.

209
08:38.997 --> 08:40.196
The voting result is clear.

210
08:40.556 --> 08:41.157
I hereby announce

211
08:41.676 --> 08:43.357
that while Mr. Yu Jianguo recuperates,

212
08:43.676 --> 08:45.397
signing authority for Jiali Cosmetics

213
08:45.637 --> 08:47.556
will be held by Mr. Di Liren.

214
08:48.157 --> 08:49.076
Mr. Di, please say something.

215
08:59.956 --> 09:00.397
Thank you.

216
09:00.956 --> 09:01.836
Thank you, shareholders,

217
09:02.196 --> 09:03.397
for your trust and support.

218
09:03.796 --> 09:05.596
I'll keep pushing forward as always

219
09:06.196 --> 09:06.757
to lead Jiali

220
09:07.117 --> 09:08.757
to break new ground in the domestic

221
09:09.477 --> 09:10.237
cosmetics market.

222
09:11.436 --> 09:12.237
I won't let down

223
09:12.556 --> 09:14.117
my father-in-law, Mr. Yu Jianguo.

224
09:14.836 --> 09:15.397
Everyone,

225
09:16.477 --> 09:18.556
I am Mr. Yu Jianguo's attorney.

226
09:18.916 --> 09:19.997
He has retained me

227
09:20.157 --> 09:21.076
for over 20 years.

228
09:21.477 --> 09:22.556
I believe everyone here

229
09:22.716 --> 09:23.357
knows who I am.

230
09:23.836 --> 09:24.596
I'm here today

231
09:25.037 --> 09:27.157
to read an authorization letter

232
09:27.757 --> 09:29.357
that he had notarized before his coma.

233
09:35.757 --> 09:36.916
While Mr. Yu Jianguo

234
09:36.956 --> 09:38.477
is incapacitated,

235
09:39.076 --> 09:40.477
signing authority for Jiali Cosmetics

236
09:41.157 --> 09:42.997
belongs solely to Ms. Yu Meng.

237
09:49.436 --> 09:49.916
Mr. Li,

238
09:51.076 --> 09:52.477
right after Mr. Yu fell into a coma,

239
09:52.637 --> 09:53.556
I asked you about this

240
09:53.596 --> 09:54.196
right away.

241
09:54.676 --> 09:55.877
You said he left nothing behind.

242
09:56.117 --> 09:57.277
I have reason to question

243
09:57.277 --> 09:58.037
the validity

244
09:58.037 --> 09:58.836
of the authorization

245
09:59.157 --> 10:00.157
you just produced.

246
10:01.877 --> 10:03.357
Worried about shifting circumstances,

247
10:03.916 --> 10:04.877
Mr. Yu instructed me

248
10:05.277 --> 10:06.956
to read this authorization only

249
10:06.997 --> 10:08.196
before a full assembly

250
10:08.397 --> 10:09.997
of Jiali's shareholders.

251
10:10.117 --> 10:10.916
Furthermore,

252
10:11.517 --> 10:13.316
because his coma was sudden,

253
10:13.836 --> 10:14.757
I needed time

254
10:14.836 --> 10:15.916
to finish the legal process.

255
10:16.556 --> 10:17.076
As soon

256
10:17.436 --> 10:18.237
as it was done,

257
10:18.357 --> 10:19.556
I brought it straight here.

258
10:20.436 --> 10:21.316
This notarization

259
10:22.316 --> 10:23.196
is open to review.

260
10:29.037 --> 10:29.716
Ms. Yu,

261
10:30.997 --> 10:31.477
congrats.

262
10:34.357 --> 10:35.556
I'll continue to serve

263
10:35.716 --> 10:36.517
Mr. Yu faithfully.

264
10:36.517 --> 10:37.037
Thank you,

265
10:37.517 --> 10:38.076
Mr. Li.

266
10:44.489 --> 10:46.248
(Yu Jianguo)

267
11:01.836 --> 11:02.757
This is my first day

268
11:02.757 --> 11:03.877
with signing authority at Jiali.

269
11:04.277 --> 11:05.037
I hope

270
11:05.517 --> 11:06.637
this is only the beginning.

271
11:06.997 --> 11:08.796
I'll do my duty

272
11:09.556 --> 11:10.796
and own the responsibility.

273
11:11.757 --> 11:12.757
I will do everything

274
11:12.796 --> 11:13.796
in my power

275
11:14.397 --> 11:15.196
to get Jiali

276
11:15.716 --> 11:16.556
back on track.

277
11:34.956 --> 11:35.637
Come in.

278
11:41.397 --> 11:42.477
These are from Mr. Di.

279
11:42.596 --> 11:43.477
He heard you've been

280
11:43.477 --> 11:44.637
signing papers all morning

281
11:44.836 --> 11:45.757
and was really worried.

282
11:49.637 --> 11:51.397
He's just using concern

283
11:51.596 --> 11:52.237
as an excuse

284
11:52.277 --> 11:53.397
to rush me.

285
11:54.517 --> 11:55.397
You came just in time.

286
11:55.676 --> 11:57.157
I've reviewed these files.

287
11:58.477 --> 11:59.436
However,

288
12:00.877 --> 12:01.556
I cannot sign this.

289
12:03.588 --> 12:04.008
(Jiangzhou Jiali Cosmetics)

290
12:04.008 --> 12:04.485
(Application for Jinghua Series Production Expansion)

291
12:10.237 --> 12:12.196
Additional production order for Jinghua

292
12:12.436 --> 12:13.517
is an internal decision

293
12:13.556 --> 12:14.357
made by the company.

294
12:15.477 --> 12:16.676
How can Meng refuse to sign

295
12:16.676 --> 12:17.517
on a whim?

296
12:18.117 --> 12:19.556
Did she tell you

297
12:19.556 --> 12:20.436
beforehand?

298
12:21.477 --> 12:21.997
No.

299
12:22.997 --> 12:23.877
But I'm sure

300
12:24.316 --> 12:25.517
she has her reasons.

301
12:26.916 --> 12:27.757
She may act

302
12:27.956 --> 12:28.956
on impulse at times,

303
12:29.716 --> 12:30.596
but she's always careful

304
12:30.916 --> 12:31.796
with company matters.

305
12:31.836 --> 12:33.556
Not consulting anyone

306
12:34.316 --> 12:35.076
isn't being careful.

307
12:35.637 --> 12:36.997
It's pure recklessness.

308
12:39.556 --> 12:40.637
Don't make excuses for her.

309
12:41.436 --> 12:42.237
Signing authority

310
12:42.796 --> 12:44.076
shouldn't be used like this.

311
12:45.196 --> 12:46.517
We need to talk to her properly.

312
13:05.436 --> 13:06.037
Honey,

313
13:07.157 --> 13:08.157
if Dad saw you so sad

314
13:08.157 --> 13:09.076
every single day,

315
13:09.477 --> 13:10.796
it would crush him.

316
13:14.517 --> 13:16.157
Why would I be sad?

317
13:21.796 --> 13:23.637
I can finally carry out

318
13:24.237 --> 13:25.037
the task Dad gave me

319
13:25.037 --> 13:26.117
before he fell into a coma.

320
13:26.757 --> 13:27.556
What task?

321
13:28.037 --> 13:28.997
Auditing Jinghua's accounts.

322
13:30.757 --> 13:31.637
Really?

323
13:36.596 --> 13:38.316
Before Dad fell into a coma, he told me

324
13:38.637 --> 13:39.796
that someone in the company

325
13:39.997 --> 13:41.037
tried to use Jinghua

326
13:41.117 --> 13:42.836
for illegal profit,

327
13:43.157 --> 13:44.196
hurting the company.

328
13:44.757 --> 13:45.757
To catch that person,

329
13:46.037 --> 13:47.196
I must audit Jinghua's accounts

330
13:47.596 --> 13:48.237
and find the evidence.

331
13:49.757 --> 13:51.397
That's why I can't approve

332
13:52.237 --> 13:53.997
any Jinghua documents

333
13:54.556 --> 13:55.716
for now.

334
13:56.556 --> 13:57.277
But

335
13:57.997 --> 13:58.796
Dad never mentioned it

336
13:58.877 --> 13:59.716
to me before.

337
14:00.716 --> 14:01.196
Mr. Tian,

338
14:02.277 --> 14:02.956
did my dad

339
14:02.997 --> 14:03.757
mention it to you?

340
14:04.357 --> 14:04.877
No.

341
14:07.716 --> 14:09.477
Dad only recently confirmed

342
14:09.836 --> 14:10.796
there was a problem

343
14:10.836 --> 14:11.517
with the project.

344
14:13.436 --> 14:14.877
His health was failing

345
14:15.357 --> 14:16.237
by then,

346
14:16.956 --> 14:18.157
so he gave the task to me.

347
14:18.757 --> 14:19.836
Just when he was about

348
14:19.877 --> 14:20.916
to tell you both,

349
14:21.836 --> 14:22.556
he suddenly...

350
14:25.596 --> 14:26.556
He suddenly

351
14:26.556 --> 14:27.637
collapsed.

352
14:28.316 --> 14:29.796
An audit is complicated.

353
14:29.997 --> 14:31.237
Why would Dad burden you

354
14:31.316 --> 14:32.076
with such a task?

355
14:32.196 --> 14:32.716
Exactly.

356
14:33.757 --> 14:34.477
Logically,

357
14:35.037 --> 14:35.637
for an audit,

358
14:35.997 --> 14:37.037
Liren is a better fit.

359
14:37.716 --> 14:38.916
Meng, you know nothing about it.

360
14:39.477 --> 14:40.237
You're right.

361
14:41.076 --> 14:41.757
Dad said

362
14:41.796 --> 14:42.716
the same at first.

363
14:43.556 --> 14:44.877
But then he considered

364
14:45.477 --> 14:46.637
that Liren is the chairman

365
14:46.956 --> 14:48.117
with a heavy burden.

366
14:49.076 --> 14:50.157
Besides,

367
14:50.517 --> 14:51.757
auditing accounts

368
14:52.076 --> 14:53.157
easily offends people.

369
14:53.877 --> 14:56.076
Someone like me, new to the company

370
14:56.316 --> 14:57.316
and pretty free,

371
14:57.316 --> 14:58.196
was better suited.

372
14:59.117 --> 15:00.637
So he gave me the signing authority.

373
15:02.517 --> 15:03.397
Dad also said

374
15:04.637 --> 15:05.796
I must uncover the person

375
15:05.997 --> 15:06.997
who's deceiving the board

376
15:07.117 --> 15:08.477
for personal gain.

377
15:15.117 --> 15:15.716
Liren,

378
15:16.556 --> 15:17.676
Dad said once you knew

379
15:17.676 --> 15:18.277
about all this,

380
15:18.716 --> 15:19.556
you would back me up

381
15:19.796 --> 15:21.157
and understand me

382
15:21.397 --> 15:21.916
one hundred percent.

383
15:22.277 --> 15:22.757
Right?

384
15:24.237 --> 15:24.676
Of course.

385
15:26.076 --> 15:26.877
But an audit

386
15:26.956 --> 15:27.877
is a big deal.

387
15:28.956 --> 15:29.357
Dad

388
15:29.477 --> 15:30.596
rushed the handoff

389
15:31.517 --> 15:32.196
without leaving

390
15:32.316 --> 15:33.637
any workable plan.

391
15:34.796 --> 15:35.836
Shouldn't we

392
15:35.916 --> 15:36.716
think this through?

393
15:36.916 --> 15:37.517
No need.

394
15:37.956 --> 15:38.676
Dad already hired

395
15:38.716 --> 15:39.517
an audit team.

396
15:39.956 --> 15:40.836
How could there be

397
15:40.836 --> 15:41.637
no plan at all?

398
15:42.157 --> 15:42.556
It takes

399
15:42.637 --> 15:43.757
only one phone call from me,

400
15:44.037 --> 15:45.357
and they will start immediately.

401
15:45.596 --> 15:47.436
Yu even arranged the audit?

402
15:49.836 --> 15:52.037
Dad gave strict orders

403
15:52.196 --> 15:53.357
not to tell a soul

404
15:53.637 --> 15:54.757
until the final moment.

405
15:55.477 --> 15:56.916
He feared a heads-up

406
15:57.117 --> 15:58.117
would alert them

407
15:58.397 --> 15:59.357
and sabotage the audit.

408
16:00.316 --> 16:00.676
Right,

409
16:01.196 --> 16:01.997
Dad also said

410
16:02.477 --> 16:04.076
whoever tries to stop the audit

411
16:04.436 --> 16:05.157
is definitely

412
16:05.157 --> 16:06.316
the prime suspect.

413
16:09.316 --> 16:10.117
The finance team

414
16:10.157 --> 16:11.357
has all the audit materials

415
16:11.357 --> 16:12.196
ready.

416
16:12.836 --> 16:14.076
The audit can begin at any time.

417
16:14.357 --> 16:15.517
Ask me if anything comes up.

418
16:19.196 --> 16:20.397
Your dad was quite farsighted.

419
16:20.757 --> 16:21.757
He gave signing authority

420
16:21.796 --> 16:22.316
to you

421
16:22.477 --> 16:23.237
and even lined up

422
16:23.237 --> 16:23.916
the audit team.

423
16:26.357 --> 16:27.637
You only got the first part right.

424
16:27.997 --> 16:29.477
I hired the audit team myself.

425
16:30.037 --> 16:31.196
You mean

426
16:31.916 --> 16:33.676
everything you just said about the audit

427
16:33.956 --> 16:34.796
was made up?

428
16:37.316 --> 16:38.277
The signing authority

429
16:38.397 --> 16:39.477
did come from my dad,

430
16:39.637 --> 16:40.316
but I made up

431
16:40.517 --> 16:42.196
the rest on the spot.

432
16:44.037 --> 16:45.037
No wonder you're good

433
16:45.037 --> 16:45.676
at content.

434
16:46.117 --> 16:47.277
Your ability to spin a story

435
16:47.397 --> 16:48.357
is truly top-notch.

436
16:49.436 --> 16:50.916
I had to bluster through.

437
16:52.877 --> 16:53.877
I finally had a chance

438
16:53.877 --> 16:54.916
to audit the accounts.

439
16:55.117 --> 16:56.196
I had to seize it.

440
16:56.436 --> 16:57.316
I made a way

441
16:57.316 --> 16:57.997
when there was none

442
16:58.157 --> 16:58.997
to reach my goal.

443
16:59.277 --> 16:59.676
Got it?

444
17:00.076 --> 17:00.836
Impressive.

445
17:02.517 --> 17:03.037
So,

446
17:03.237 --> 17:04.517
you don't know why your dad

447
17:04.556 --> 17:05.636
gave you the signing authority?

448
17:06.037 --> 17:06.836
Actually,

449
17:07.596 --> 17:08.717
when my dad was hospitalized,

450
17:09.517 --> 17:10.197
he handed me

451
17:10.197 --> 17:11.277
an insurance policy one day.

452
17:11.876 --> 17:12.836
Later, I realized

453
17:13.237 --> 17:14.556
what he wanted to leave me

454
17:15.237 --> 17:16.316
was definitely

455
17:16.556 --> 17:18.037
more than just a policy.

456
17:18.477 --> 17:19.037
That's the bond

457
17:19.116 --> 17:20.237
between father and daughter.

458
17:20.717 --> 17:22.156
He must have planned long ago

459
17:23.517 --> 17:24.717
how to protect me

460
17:26.197 --> 17:27.477
when he was no longer around.

461
17:27.997 --> 17:28.396
Zhang Tao,

462
17:29.156 --> 17:30.277
keep an eye

463
17:30.277 --> 17:31.477
on the audit team for now.

464
17:31.876 --> 17:32.556
Report to me

465
17:32.876 --> 17:33.717
if anything comes up.

466
17:48.197 --> 17:48.517
Hello?

467
17:49.076 --> 17:50.917
The Jinghua audit is making quite a stir.

468
17:51.757 --> 17:52.437
Then what about

469
17:52.437 --> 17:53.997
my six million payment?

470
17:54.596 --> 17:55.277
You need to wait.

471
17:56.156 --> 17:56.836
Due to the audit,

472
17:58.076 --> 17:59.437
all project-related payments

473
17:59.677 --> 18:00.396
have been frozen.

474
18:01.197 --> 18:02.757
I don't mind waiting,

475
18:03.076 --> 18:04.997
but Mr. Weng isn't easy to deal with.

476
18:05.316 --> 18:06.757
He needs to see the money

477
18:06.796 --> 18:08.316
before the 15th of this month.

478
18:08.717 --> 18:10.396
If we keep stalling, he'll get suspicious.

479
18:12.156 --> 18:12.836
I'll figure it out.

480
18:13.677 --> 18:14.596
Money is a minor issue.

481
18:15.396 --> 18:16.836
The key is that the signing authority

482
18:16.876 --> 18:18.037
fell into Yu Meng's hands.

483
18:18.116 --> 18:19.917
It caught me off guard and left me passive.

484
18:20.277 --> 18:21.037
That woman

485
18:21.556 --> 18:22.556
is surprisingly shrewd.

486
18:22.957 --> 18:23.957
She's far deeper

487
18:23.997 --> 18:25.116
than she appears.

488
18:27.677 --> 18:29.037
She is your wife, after all.

489
18:29.437 --> 18:30.636
She's quite capable,

490
18:32.277 --> 18:33.596
maybe even one step ahead of you.

491
18:34.116 --> 18:35.316
I underestimated her before.

492
18:36.957 --> 18:38.156
Starting now,

493
18:38.596 --> 18:40.277
it's not too late to take her on.

494
18:41.156 --> 18:42.076
I'll take back

495
18:42.796 --> 18:43.677
the signing authority.

496
18:44.037 --> 18:44.677
How?

497
18:48.396 --> 18:48.917
Let's talk in person.

498
18:54.917 --> 18:55.997
Han Guang needs 6 million.

499
18:56.556 --> 18:57.757
Transfer it to him when you can.

500
18:57.876 --> 18:58.677
6 million yuan?

501
18:59.957 --> 19:00.677
Why does he suddenly

502
19:00.677 --> 19:01.596
need that much?

503
19:02.717 --> 19:03.277
Did something

504
19:03.316 --> 19:04.237
go wrong with Jinghua?

505
19:05.636 --> 19:06.356
No.

506
19:06.757 --> 19:08.156
If Jinghua were in trouble,

507
19:08.316 --> 19:09.556
6 million wasn't nearly enough.

508
19:10.517 --> 19:11.396
He needs money

509
19:11.556 --> 19:12.316
for overseas cash flow

510
19:12.876 --> 19:14.277
and to pave the way for Jinghua's

511
19:14.477 --> 19:15.037
funds.

512
19:17.076 --> 19:17.636
Understood.

513
19:43.517 --> 19:44.197
What are you reading?

514
19:51.917 --> 19:53.076
(Chairman's Wife Thinks I'm the Mistress) I recognize every word

515
19:53.076 --> 19:54.037
in this post,

516
19:54.037 --> 19:55.156
but put together,

517
19:55.437 --> 19:56.876
how will this stop

518
19:56.957 --> 19:58.917
Yu Meng from auditing the accounts?

519
20:00.717 --> 20:01.717
What if

520
20:02.876 --> 20:03.917
I make all of Jiali believe

521
20:03.997 --> 20:05.156
Yu Meng audits the accounts

522
20:05.556 --> 20:06.356
not for the company

523
20:07.237 --> 20:07.957
but to investigate

524
20:07.997 --> 20:09.556
my alleged affair in the name of work?

525
20:10.396 --> 20:11.197
What do you mean?

526
20:15.076 --> 20:16.556
Yu Meng suspects I'm cheating.

527
20:16.717 --> 20:18.197
Before Chen Chen and Wen Xiaoxiao,

528
20:18.836 --> 20:19.876
she suspected someone else.

529
20:20.116 --> 20:20.997
Aren't we buddies?

530
20:22.917 --> 20:24.197
Stop beating around the bush.

531
20:24.636 --> 20:26.076
Just spit it out. I don't get it.

532
20:28.717 --> 20:29.277
Weng Yue.

533
20:31.437 --> 20:32.156
Remember that day

534
20:32.556 --> 20:33.836
Yu Meng visited the tennis court

535
20:34.396 --> 20:35.237
and met Weng Yue

536
20:35.237 --> 20:35.997
for the first time?

537
20:37.677 --> 20:38.796
It was to catch me cheating.

538
20:40.556 --> 20:41.556
And Weng Yue

539
20:42.037 --> 20:43.197
is also involved in Jinghua.

540
20:46.997 --> 20:48.237
Let me guess.

541
20:48.917 --> 20:51.396
You want everyone at Jiali to think

542
20:51.517 --> 20:52.636
Yu Meng is targeting

543
20:52.757 --> 20:53.796
Weng Yue,

544
20:53.836 --> 20:54.677
so she's using

545
20:54.677 --> 20:56.037
the Jinghua audit

546
20:57.437 --> 20:58.596
to make a big scene.

547
20:59.917 --> 21:00.596
Smart.

548
21:02.717 --> 21:03.876
Once this post

549
21:04.116 --> 21:05.596
blows up on Jiali's

550
21:05.677 --> 21:06.677
internal forum,

551
21:08.277 --> 21:10.076
the narrative will be set.

552
21:11.477 --> 21:12.396
You sly old fox.

553
21:15.037 --> 21:15.717
You caught Di Liren

554
21:15.717 --> 21:16.957
completely off guard.

555
21:17.237 --> 21:18.636
He'll find a way to retaliate.

556
21:18.957 --> 21:19.517
I have no idea

557
21:19.556 --> 21:20.316
what dirty tricks

558
21:20.316 --> 21:21.197
he'll pull.

559
21:22.037 --> 21:23.116
The dirtier his moves,

560
21:23.517 --> 21:24.876
the easier he is to catch.

561
21:30.156 --> 21:30.796
All right,

562
21:31.277 --> 21:31.997
stop staring.

563
21:32.917 --> 21:33.356
Go on.

564
21:35.596 --> 21:37.156
Take the coffee to your goddess.

565
21:37.677 --> 21:38.316
Keep it down.

566
21:39.717 --> 21:40.277
I'm not going.

567
21:40.677 --> 21:42.076
What are you being so shy about?

568
21:42.197 --> 21:43.037
Even if she's married,

569
21:43.116 --> 21:44.076
you can still be friends.

570
21:44.556 --> 21:45.116
Go on.

571
21:45.836 --> 21:46.477
Your coffee.

572
21:46.757 --> 21:47.076
Thanks.

573
21:47.556 --> 21:47.997
Enjoy.

574
21:48.796 --> 21:50.076
Aren't you helping the manager

575
21:50.116 --> 21:51.037
with design work?

576
21:51.316 --> 21:51.836
Why are you

577
21:51.836 --> 21:52.717
waiting tables too?

578
21:53.876 --> 21:54.796
More skills never hurt.

579
21:56.997 --> 21:57.517
Harry,

580
21:57.917 --> 21:59.037
you need to fix this design.

581
21:59.156 --> 21:59.677
Come on in.

582
22:00.997 --> 22:01.796
I need to go.

583
22:02.076 --> 22:02.556
Enjoy.

584
22:03.116 --> 22:03.556
Go ahead.

585
22:04.957 --> 22:06.156
Why does he seem off today?

586
22:06.316 --> 22:06.997
He looks unhappy.

587
22:08.437 --> 22:09.237
A little bit, yeah.

588
22:09.396 --> 22:10.596
This design

589
22:10.717 --> 22:12.316
isn't giving the vibe I want.

590
22:12.356 --> 22:13.116
Not quite it.

591
22:14.316 --> 22:15.076
Why don't you

592
22:15.396 --> 22:16.396
tweak it a bit more?

593
22:16.997 --> 22:18.156
I want that classic

594
22:18.556 --> 22:19.876
coffeehouse feel.

595
22:20.277 --> 22:20.876
Do you get me?

596
22:21.477 --> 22:22.156
Honestly,

597
22:22.316 --> 22:23.796
all 16 versions you gave me

598
22:23.957 --> 22:25.477
are sort of there,

599
22:25.876 --> 22:27.517
but they lack punch.

600
22:28.037 --> 22:29.037
Why not merge them

601
22:29.677 --> 22:30.596
into one

602
22:30.677 --> 22:31.556
and blend them?

603
22:32.396 --> 22:33.277
Graphic design

604
22:33.277 --> 22:34.076
isn't juicing fruit.

605
22:37.517 --> 22:38.437
Excuse me, sir.

606
22:40.237 --> 22:40.917
Hello.

607
22:41.356 --> 22:41.876
Get up.

608
22:42.556 --> 22:43.037
Sir,

609
22:43.237 --> 22:44.076
I know

610
22:44.076 --> 22:45.197
a top-tier designer.

611
22:45.356 --> 22:46.356
Would you like to hire him?

612
22:47.757 --> 22:48.316
Sure.

613
22:48.517 --> 22:49.836
He's a bit pricey,

614
22:50.237 --> 22:51.237
I should say.

615
22:51.396 --> 22:52.836
But since we know each other,

616
22:53.116 --> 22:54.437
I can offer you 20% off.

617
22:54.876 --> 22:55.356
How is that?

618
22:55.876 --> 22:56.556
It costs money?

619
22:56.717 --> 22:57.796
Of course it does.

620
22:58.796 --> 22:59.277
Harry,

621
23:00.197 --> 23:01.076
how much did he pay you

622
23:01.116 --> 23:01.876
for the design work?

623
23:02.677 --> 23:03.677
We're friends,

624
23:03.876 --> 23:04.796
so money never came up.

625
23:04.836 --> 23:06.037
Besides, his cafe

626
23:06.037 --> 23:07.116
has been doing badly lately.

627
23:07.316 --> 23:08.517
He asked me to see

628
23:08.796 --> 23:09.556
if I could help.

629
23:10.757 --> 23:11.556
He bought me a meal.

630
23:14.477 --> 23:16.277
What meal was worth so much

631
23:16.477 --> 23:17.677
that it covered your design fee?

632
23:18.437 --> 23:19.076
What did you eat?

633
23:19.876 --> 23:20.396
Instant noodles.

634
23:20.717 --> 23:21.396
Instant noodles?

635
23:22.356 --> 23:23.997
You only bought him instant noodles?

636
23:24.477 --> 23:25.636
Once I start making money,

637
23:25.836 --> 23:26.717
I'll make it up to him.

638
23:28.517 --> 23:29.316
Tell me,

639
23:29.596 --> 23:30.596
are we friends?

640
23:30.957 --> 23:31.356
Of course.

641
23:31.717 --> 23:32.957
Then this coffee can be

642
23:33.116 --> 23:33.876
your treat, right?

643
23:34.156 --> 23:34.556
Of course.

644
23:34.796 --> 23:36.437
Too bad I don't see you as a friend.

645
23:36.757 --> 23:37.596
I have paid for it.

646
23:37.997 --> 23:38.356
Let's go.

647
23:38.836 --> 23:39.277
Where to?

648
23:40.517 --> 23:41.677
I certainly won't buy you

649
23:41.717 --> 23:42.437
instant noodles.

650
23:42.677 --> 23:43.316
I'm treating you

651
23:43.396 --> 23:44.197
to a real meal.

652
23:44.316 --> 23:44.796
Just pack.

653
23:49.396 --> 23:49.836
I'm off.

654
23:50.957 --> 23:51.596
Let's go, Zi.

655
23:57.197 --> 23:59.076
Come on.

656
23:59.277 --> 24:01.156
Eat up.

657
24:01.636 --> 24:02.316
Meng,

658
24:03.156 --> 24:04.116
you're so nice to me.

659
24:05.477 --> 24:06.197
No drama.

660
24:07.197 --> 24:07.757
We friends

661
24:07.757 --> 24:08.957
haven't gathered in a while,

662
24:09.237 --> 24:10.316
so I thought it'd be nice

663
24:10.556 --> 24:11.556
to have a meal together.

664
24:12.156 --> 24:12.836
Friends...

665
24:13.076 --> 24:13.717
We're here.

666
24:15.757 --> 24:16.237
Come on.

667
24:16.237 --> 24:16.757
What's that?

668
24:16.796 --> 24:17.477
You brought those

669
24:17.477 --> 24:17.997
for dinner?

670
24:17.997 --> 24:18.957
I'm backing Harry up.

671
24:19.316 --> 24:20.596
I hate freeloaders the most.

672
24:20.836 --> 24:21.636
Take me to that guy.

673
24:21.796 --> 24:22.517
I'll deal with him.

674
24:23.316 --> 24:23.997
Xu will come too.

675
24:24.437 --> 24:24.997
We'll get your pay.

676
24:25.197 --> 24:25.876
You can't work for free.

677
24:26.677 --> 24:27.316
Please don't.

678
24:27.477 --> 24:28.197
Calm down.

679
24:28.596 --> 24:29.836
I don't want any trouble, and...

680
24:30.517 --> 24:32.037
I don't want to hurt a friend.

681
24:32.277 --> 24:33.396
You still call him a friend?

682
24:34.277 --> 24:35.156
You're a man.

683
24:35.356 --> 24:36.437
Have some backbone.

684
24:36.997 --> 24:38.156
Knock it off. What's with you?

685
24:38.396 --> 24:38.757
Sit down.

686
24:43.076 --> 24:43.677
I'm so mad.

687
24:45.836 --> 24:47.237
Thank you all for your kindness.

688
24:47.757 --> 24:50.356
I really don't have many friends.

689
24:50.757 --> 24:52.237
Because since I was little,

690
24:53.556 --> 24:54.677
I've had a heart condition.

691
24:54.677 --> 24:56.396
Kids listened to their parents

692
24:56.437 --> 24:58.156
and wouldn't play with me.

693
24:58.477 --> 24:59.197
But later on,

694
24:59.437 --> 25:00.237
I got better,

695
25:00.437 --> 25:01.197
and I went abroad.

696
25:02.876 --> 25:03.437
But I never

697
25:04.076 --> 25:04.957
learned to make friends

698
25:04.957 --> 25:05.517
normally.

699
25:05.957 --> 25:06.717
So I often

700
25:07.396 --> 25:08.037
try too hard

701
