773
27:27.396 --> 27:29.156
Have you heard of Tetralogy of Fallot?

774
27:29.917 --> 27:31.156
Tetralogy of Fallot?

775
27:32.917 --> 27:33.997
But I've recovered well.

776
27:34.556 --> 27:35.596
I won't cause you

777
27:35.636 --> 27:36.237
