900
31:15.116 --> 31:15.836
Things like that.

901
31:17.636 --> 31:18.076
Not bad.

902
31:18.957 --> 31:19.997
You know your enemy well.

903
31:23.237 --> 31:23.757
He has

904
31:23.917 --> 31:25.277
