941
32:36.757 --> 32:38.037
It's all just a twist of fate.

942
32:41.437 --> 32:43.197
A twist of fate?

943
32:43.717 --> 32:45.596
Fate certainly has a twisted sense of humor.

944
32:46.037 --> 32:47.556
Do you think Harry

945
32:47.917 --> 32:48.876
really knows

946
32:48.876 --> 32:49.997
