1040
35:57.837 --> 35:58.596
With your face,

1041
35:58.877 --> 35:59.756
even a zoo

1042
35:59.997 --> 36:00.756
wouldn't want you.

1043
36:01.997 --> 36:02.596
What did you say?

1044
36:02.997 --> 36:03.676
You.

1045
36:03.676 --> 36:04.116
What?

1046
36:04.437 --> 36:05.357
Not only are you ugly,

1047
36:05.477 --> 36:06.716
you're deaf too, pal?

1048
36:07.236 --> 36:07.917
What did you say?

1049
36:07.917 --> 36:08.676
You brat.

1050
36:08.676 --> 36:09.676
Acting tough with me?

1051
36:13.317 --> 36:13.877
Darn you.

1052
36:14.357 --> 36:15.156
Who the heck are you?

1053
36:15.556 --> 36:16.477
How dare you insult Meng!

1054
36:16.477 --> 36:17.196
You just wait!

1055
36:17.756 --> 36:19.196
Stop fighting!

1056
36:19.437 --> 36:20.317
Break it up!

1057
36:21.716 --> 36:22.236
Get off!

1058
36:23.437 --> 36:23.997
Stop it! Stop!

1059
36:23.997 --> 36:24.477
Get off!

1060
36:39.236 --> 36:39.676
Hello.

1061
36:40.517 --> 36:41.236
Can we talk?

1062
36:42.397 --> 36:42.797
Sure.

1063
36:43.236 --> 36:44.477
Say whatever you want.

1064
36:45.636 --> 36:46.437
(Who the heck are you?)

1065
36:46.756 --> 36:47.636
(How dare you insult Meng!)

1066
36:48.917 --> 36:50.276
(You think I won't hurt you?)

1067
36:51.156 --> 36:51.957
(Get off me!)

1068
36:52.276 --> 36:52.676
(Get up!)

1069
36:53.556 --> 36:54.116
Harry?

1070
36:54.676 --> 36:55.276
(Stop it! Stop!)

1071
36:56.837 --> 36:57.317
(Get up!)

1072
37:02.116 --> 37:02.797
Are you sure?

1073
37:03.596 --> 37:04.636
I heard it myself.

1074
37:05.076 --> 37:05.797
They said

1075
37:06.037 --> 37:07.676
Yu Meng will officially take over

1076
37:07.756 --> 37:08.756
signing authority at Jiali.

1077
37:09.837 --> 37:10.236
Or

1078
37:10.556 --> 37:11.477
you can ask around

1079
37:11.676 --> 37:12.517
at Jiali yourself.

1080
37:18.357 --> 37:18.997
Thank you.

1081
37:28.192 --> 37:29.278
(Xie Xuexia)

1082
37:33.183 --> 37:33.952
(Unknown Number)

1083
37:36.156 --> 37:36.636
Hello?

1084
37:37.877 --> 37:38.917
He's with the police?

1085
37:39.317 --> 37:42.156
(Shun'an Police Station)

1086
37:42.156 --> 37:44.156
Since both sides agreed to settle,

1087
37:44.517 --> 37:46.156
this will just be a verbal warning.

1088
37:46.877 --> 37:47.877
Don't be so reckless again.

1089
37:48.957 --> 37:49.797
Thank you, Officer.

1090
37:50.156 --> 37:51.877
I'll make sure he learns his lesson.

1091
37:57.556 --> 37:58.196
How are you?

1092
37:58.517 --> 37:58.997
Are you okay?

1093
37:59.037 --> 37:59.756
I'm fine.

1094
37:59.957 --> 38:00.917
Just got kicked.

1095
38:01.156 --> 38:01.556
Besides,

1096
38:02.076 --> 38:02.756
I didn't lose.

1097
38:04.236 --> 38:05.556
Winning or losing doesn't matter.

1098
38:05.756 --> 38:06.357
Your injuries

1099
38:06.357 --> 38:07.556
are all too real.

1100
38:08.116 --> 38:09.917
Those people were just spewing nonsense.

1101
38:10.196 --> 38:11.276
No need to fight them.

1102
38:12.437 --> 38:13.276
You heard about it?

1103
38:17.957 --> 38:20.116
You really are like a good little brother.

1104
38:21.156 --> 38:22.877
When you get a girlfriend,

1105
38:23.196 --> 38:24.676
I'll put in a good word for you.

1106
38:25.716 --> 38:26.517
I have no girlfriend.

1107
38:27.877 --> 38:28.797
Not right now,

1108
38:28.797 --> 38:29.917
but you will eventually.

1109
38:30.196 --> 38:30.957
With so many girls

1110
38:30.957 --> 38:31.797
at your school,

1111
38:31.997 --> 38:33.317
if you like someone, go for it.

1112
38:33.517 --> 38:34.236
At school,

1113
38:34.517 --> 38:35.716
I only focus on my studies.

1114
38:36.676 --> 38:37.437
Speaking of which,

1115
38:37.477 --> 38:38.797
isn't your break almost over?

1116
38:39.037 --> 38:40.397
Shouldn't you head back to school?

1117
38:40.877 --> 38:42.076
Instead of studying theory,

1118
38:42.517 --> 38:43.517
I'd rather stay

1119
38:43.556 --> 38:44.397
and study buildings.

1120
38:45.156 --> 38:45.877
Then

1121
38:47.156 --> 38:48.156
what do your parents say?

1122
38:48.797 --> 38:49.437
Them?

1123
38:49.797 --> 38:50.957
They don't want me in architecture.

1124
38:51.037 --> 38:52.716
They want me to get a master's and PhD

1125
38:52.797 --> 38:53.716
and teach at school.

1126
38:53.837 --> 38:54.556
So I kept it

1127
38:54.997 --> 38:56.156
from them when I came back

1128
38:56.357 --> 38:57.437
to study buildings.

1129
38:58.636 --> 39:00.156
Actually, I think

1130
39:00.477 --> 39:01.517
you could take

1131
39:01.517 --> 39:02.477
your parents' advice.

1132
39:02.797 --> 39:03.877
Being abroad,

1133
39:04.156 --> 39:05.477
you might be happier.

1134
39:07.076 --> 39:08.116
I'm pretty happy now.

1135
39:11.676 --> 39:12.397
Hello?

1136
39:14.276 --> 39:15.076
Where are you?

1137
39:15.957 --> 39:16.917
Okay, I see you.

1138
39:18.716 --> 39:19.636
I hailed a car for you.

1139
39:19.837 --> 39:21.076
It'll take you to the hospital.

1140
39:21.477 --> 39:22.037
And you?

1141
39:22.596 --> 39:23.837
I've got a lot on at work.

1142
39:24.317 --> 39:25.357
Come on. I'll see you off.

1143
39:35.837 --> 39:36.156
Hello?

1144
39:36.676 --> 39:37.276
Hello, Mom.

1145
39:38.756 --> 39:39.636
No need to come.

1146
39:40.037 --> 39:40.917
My friend helped me out.

1147
39:43.756 --> 39:44.477
What friend?

1148
39:44.877 --> 39:45.716
The lady

1149
39:45.837 --> 39:46.596
from the cafe.

1150
40:06.236 --> 40:06.636
Ding,

1151
40:07.037 --> 40:07.636
put together

1152
40:07.676 --> 40:08.477
the employees'

1153
40:08.676 --> 40:10.037
comments and names from the company forum.

1154
40:28.465 --> 40:31.174
=The Vanishing Beauty= (Next Episode Preview)

1155
40:31.276 --> 40:33.116
Isn't this your friend Meng?

1156
40:34.276 --> 40:34.716
(Lucky Beauty Yu) Look,

1157
40:35.437 --> 40:36.676
she's an influencer.

1158
40:37.517 --> 40:38.517
She never mentioned it.

1159
40:42.196 --> 40:42.596
Dad?

1160
40:44.196 --> 40:45.076
You two are so sweet.

1161
40:45.837 --> 40:47.076
A fan wants to ask Mr. Di:

1162
40:47.437 --> 40:48.716
Are you so nice only to Meng

1163
40:48.957 --> 40:49.756
or to everyone?

1164
40:50.636 --> 40:50.837
All right,

1165
40:50.917 --> 40:51.517
our second question

1166
40:51.556 --> 40:52.317
is also for Mr. Di.

1167
40:52.917 --> 40:54.477
What's more important

1168
40:54.756 --> 40:55.877
for a family,

1169
40:56.517 --> 40:57.276
money or time?

1170
40:57.676 --> 40:58.156
When did you

1171
40:58.156 --> 40:58.797
meet Yu Meng?

1172
40:58.957 --> 40:59.596
What about you?

1173
40:59.877 --> 41:01.037
Why pretend not to know me?

1174
41:01.397 --> 41:02.156
And since when

1175
41:03.236 --> 41:03.917
are you Di Liren?

1176
41:15.899 --> 41:19.331
♪We are broken butterflies♪

1177
41:19.608 --> 41:22.463
♪Can't fly beyond the boundary of fate♪

1178
41:22.832 --> 41:25.660
♪Wings torn apart by the night♪

1179
41:25.660 --> 41:29.475
♪Still seeking open fields in the ruins♪

1180
41:29.475 --> 41:31.116
♪Locked inside a pendulum♪

1181
41:31.116 --> 41:32.821
♪Repeating the same fate♪

1182
41:32.821 --> 41:34.249
♪I hear high heels♪

1183
41:34.249 --> 41:36.018
♪Crushing silent replies♪

1184
41:36.018 --> 41:37.659
♪Every step feels like a trial♪

1185
41:37.659 --> 41:39.151
♪Yet sobers me up♪

1186
41:39.151 --> 41:41.048
♪Love is a thorny rose♪

1187
41:41.048 --> 41:42.582
♪Promises are mere anesthesia♪

1188
41:42.582 --> 41:44.330
♪I once gave it my all♪

1189
41:44.330 --> 41:46.206
♪Only to be shattered in pieces♪

1190
41:46.397 --> 41:48.017
♪Now I forge my tears♪

1191
41:48.017 --> 41:49.658
♪Into gray diamond gems♪

1192
41:49.658 --> 41:51.470
♪No longer asking who's right or wrong♪

1193
41:51.470 --> 41:55.754
♪Only who dares to control me♪

1194
41:56.691 --> 41:58.396
♪I am nobody's accessory♪

1195
41:58.396 --> 41:59.952
♪Nor am I anyone's failure♪

1196
41:59.952 --> 42:01.401
♪Even with broken wings♪

1197
42:01.401 --> 42:02.829
♪I can still pierce the sky♪

1198
42:02.829 --> 42:04.492
♪When all the lights go out♪

1199
42:04.492 --> 42:07.880
♪I am the final torch♪

1200
